                            <div class="avatar">EM</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="name">Eleanor M.</div>
                                <div class="meta">Patient since 2021</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="wtc-testimonial">
                        <div class="stars">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <blockquote>"My 4-year-old was terrified of doctors. Dr. Akhter made her laugh through her vaccine. She now asks when she can go back. That's a miracle."</blockquote>
                        <div class="author">
                            <div class="avatar">RP</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="name">Rajesh P.</div>
                                <div class="meta">Parent of 2</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
