                        <div class="stars">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <blockquote>"From booking online to leaving the chair, the dental experience was effortless. The clinic looks like a spa, not a hospital. And no surprise bills."</blockquote>
                        <div class="author">
                            <div class="avatar">SJ</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="name">Sofia J.</div>
                                <div class="meta">Cosmetic dental patient</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>

</odoo>
